{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07639","headline":"伤怀赠故人 · 孟云卿","name":"伤怀赠故人","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"稍稍晨鸟翔，淅淅草上霜。\n人生早罹苦，寿命恐不长。\n二十学已成，三十名不彰。\n岂无同门友，贵贱易中肠。\n驱马行万里，悠悠过帝乡。\n幸因弦歌末，得上君子堂。\n衆乐互喧奏，独子备笙簧。\n坐中无知音，安得神扬扬。\n愿因高风起，上感白日光。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"孟云卿","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_07639.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07639","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}